<script type="application/ld+json" dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{__html:"\r\n{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"@id\": \"https://dizitaladda.com/digital-marketing-course-in-gurgaon#faq\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Which is the best digital marketing course in Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"DizitalAdda offers one of the best digital marketing course options for Gurgaon students — rated 4.9/5 on Google by 25,000+ students since 2009, with a 97% placement rate, 10 live projects, a paid internship and 10+ certifications.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is there a digital marketing institute in Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"DizitalAdda serves Gurgaon students from its Greater Kailash II campus in South Delhi and through fully live online classes. Most Gurgaon professionals join live online or on weekends; for campus visits, the Yellow Line runs from Millennium City Centre to Hauz Khas, three Magenta Line stops from the campus.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"How do I reach DizitalAdda from Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"From Millennium City Centre or any Gurgaon Yellow Line station, ride straight to Hauz Khas, then take the Magenta Line three stops to Greater Kailash and exit from Gate 3 — the campus is on the 2nd Floor of Spacetime Management Pvt Ltd Design House, behind Savitri Cinema Complex, Greater Kailash II, New Delhi 110048. The trip takes about 50-60 minutes, so most Gurgaon professionals join live online or on weekends.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Can I do the course while working full-time in Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Evening (7-9 PM), weekend and fully live online batches are designed for working professionals, with recordings of every class so you never fall behind during busy weeks at work.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What is the fee for the digital marketing course in Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"The fee ranges from Rs 30,000 to Rs 95,000, depending on the course level. It includes AI tools, live projects, certifications, the paid internship and placement support. There are no hidden charges, and EMI is available. Call +91-8810606010 for the current fee.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"How long is the digital marketing course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"There are four levels: Beginners (3 months), Professionals (4 months), Advanced (6 months) and Expert (12 months). Most students start with the 4-month Professionals course.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What will I learn in the digital marketing course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"You learn SEO, Google Ads, Meta Ads, social media marketing, content writing, email and WhatsApp automation, Google Analytics 4, performance marketing and freelancing, plus 60+ AI tools and AI search skills (AEO, GEO and LLMO).\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is there digital marketing training in Gurgaon, Delhi-NCR for career switchers?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Our digital marketing training for Gurgaon, Delhi-NCR professionals helps people move from sales, operations, HR or IT into performance marketing, SEO and analytics roles. Many choose DizitalAdda as their digital marketing institute for Gurgaon and Delhi-NCR because of its live projects and 97% placement rate.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"How is DizitalAdda different from other digital marketing institutes in Gurugram and Delhi-NCR?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"DizitalAdda shares its fee upfront, pays you during the internship, teaches 60+ AI tools including AEO and GEO, and backs its results with a 4.9/5 Google rating and named alumni employers such as Growisto, Coursera, TATA CLiQ, Dentsu and Performics. Trainers are full-time working marketers, and you can join a free demo before deciding.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Do I need a technical background to join?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"No. Anyone who has passed Class 12 can join. You only need basic computer skills — trainers start from the basics.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What are the batch timings?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Morning (10 AM-12 PM), afternoon, evening (7-9 PM) and weekend batches are available, on campus and online. New batches start every 2-3 weeks.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Can I do the digital marketing course online from Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Every batch runs as fully live online classes with real-time Q&A, recordings, live projects, the same certifications and the same placement support as campus students.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Does the course include AI tools?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. You learn 60+ AI tools such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini and Perplexity, plus AEO, GEO and LLMO — skills that help brands appear in AI answers as well as on Google. Every level of our digital marketing course in Gurgaon is AI-integrated, and a dedicated Digital Marketing with Gen AI module covers prompt writing, AI content, AI ad creatives and automation.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Does DizitalAdda provide placement?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. You get 100% placement assistance — resume building, LinkedIn optimisation, mock interviews and introductions to 250+ recruiting partners, with no time limit until you are placed. DizitalAdda reports a 97% placement rate.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is there an internship?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. You get a paid in-house internship at DizitalAdda's own digital marketing agency, working on real client campaigns.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Which certifications will I get?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"You earn 10+ certifications, including Google Ads, Meta Blueprint, HubSpot, Semrush and Skill India, plus the DizitalAdda course certificate.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is a certificate alone enough to get a digital marketing job?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"No. Employers hire for proof of work. That is why every student completes 10 live projects and a paid agency internship, and leaves with a portfolio of real campaign results alongside 10+ certifications.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What salary can I expect after a digital marketing course in Gurgaon?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Entry-level digital marketing roles in Delhi typically pay around Rs 3-5 LPA, and pay rises quickly with experience and specialist skills such as performance marketing and SEO.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Is EMI available for the course fee?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Flexible EMI options are available on every course level, so you can pay in monthly instalments. Call +91-8810606010 for the plan that suits you.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Can I earn by freelancing after the course?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Yes. The course includes a freelancing module covering Fiverr, Upwork, client pitching and pricing, and startups, D2C brands, agencies and local businesses across Gurgaon and Delhi-NCR regularly hire freelancers for social media, SEO and ads.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Which course is best for working professionals?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"The Advanced (6 months) or Expert (12 months) course is best for a career change. Evening and weekend batches let you keep your job while you study.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"How do I book a free demo class?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Fill in the form on this page, call +91-8810606010 or WhatsApp the same number. The 1-hour demo is free, at the Greater Kailash II campus (Yellow Line to Hauz Khas, then Magenta Line to Greater Kailash) or online from home, and your slot is confirmed within 24 hours.\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n    "}} />


    
